# | Carlo Gavazzi EM21 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: carlo-gavazzi-em21-modbus.pdf
# | - 3-phase 4-wire DIN-rail energy meter, RS485.
# | - Holding registers (FC03), INT32 little-endian (LSW first), INT16 for PF/Hz.
# | - All addresses are 0-based protocol addresses.
# | - Scales: V×0.1, A×0.01, W/VA/VAr×0.1, PF×0.001, Hz×0.1, kWh/kVArh×0.1.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N2.
